    "summary": "Once per battle for each unit with this ability, as this unit finishes a **[normal move](vsdata:core-rule/normal-move)** in your Movement phase, you can pick 1 enemy unit it can see within 12\" and roll a D6. On a 3+, deal D3 **[mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)** to the picked unit.\n\nKeep a Bomb Squig token beside the unit until it uses this ability.",
